/* Pmi082: PRESENTATION_VIEW 'side_view' links three DRAUGHTING_CALLOUTs to a saved-view with one CLIPPING_PLANE reference; readers that do not recognise the AP242 PRESENTATION_VIEW and CLIPPING_PLANE subtypes silently discard the entire saved-view record including all clipping-plane references; receivers must detect and handle PRESENTATION_VIEW entities and must preserve CLIPPING_PLANE references across round-trip; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
